{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "sazanami.bond",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "小さな水槽の散歩",
  "summary": "雨の日、携帯水槽で海と街を歩く。金魚すくい対決つき",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.sazanami",
    "characterId": "sazanami",
    "stage": "bond"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "rest"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "雨の商店街",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "sazanami.bond.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/sazanami-bond-portable-aquarium-v1.png",
        "alt": "雨の商店街でサザナミの携帯水槽を抱えるミミ"
      },
      {
        "id": "sazanami.bond.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-casino-cafe-rain.png",
        "alt": "雨の商店街の背景"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "sazanami.bond.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "sazanami.bond.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休日、雨。金魚鉢サイズの携帯水槽を抱えて、商店街を歩いてた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "中身は、さざなみの影の、さらに一部。「街の散歩がしてみたい」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——本人希望の、初めての外出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……雨の日を、選んでくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "はい。雨なら、街じゅうがちょっとだけ海ですから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "水槽の中の影が、うれしそうに渦を巻いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女いわく、雨の日は「海が街へ迎えに来る日」だそう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "水たまり一つずつに挨拶するから、進みは遅い。耳も、心なしか弾んでる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "事件は、商店街の奥で起きた。雨天でもやってる屋台の、金魚すくい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その水槽を見た瞬間、携帯水槽の影が、ぴたりと止まった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……あの水は、狭い。金魚が、二十七匹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "水量に対して、九匹、多い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "海の採点が、始まってしまった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屋台のおやじさんが「なんだお客さん、文句あるのか」と身を乗り出す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "まずい。相手は水槽越しでも、三県を揺らす海。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "文句じゃないです!　勝負です!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私がすくった金魚のぶんだけ、水槽を広くしてあげてください!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "勢いで宣言しちゃった。接客業の、悪い癖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "かくして商店街で、バニーガール対金魚すくいの、九匹救出作戦が始まった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミ。ポイは、水と平行に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……金魚は、追わない。潮目を読んで、待つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "肩の携帯水槽から、金魚すくい実況コーチが飛ぶ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屋台の水面のどこに流れが生まれるか、彼女には全部見えるそう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は、言われた場所にポイを置くだけでよかった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "結果、九匹。ポイは最後まで破れなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "おやじさんは負けを認めて、大きい水槽を出してくれた。「あんたの相棒、何者だい」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.012c",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.012c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「海です」と答えたら、金魚を一匹おまけしてくれた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……広い水で泳ぐ金魚は、いい。九十九点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "最後の一点は、何ですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.we7zqt",
      "speakerName": "さざなみ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "満点を出すと、終わってしまう。……この散歩に、まだ続きがほしいから、一点は取っておく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨音の中で、心臓がひとつ跳ねた。採点の人の一点は、そういう使い方もできるのか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "傘を少し傾けて、携帯水槽に雨粒を届けた。海が、小さく波立った。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "sazanami.bond.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道は、まだ長い。散歩の続きを、決められる。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "sazanami.bond.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "sazanami.bond.choice.001",
          "label": "海が見える窓辺で、小さな水槽の散歩をする",
          "result": "帰りに、海の見える高台へ寄り道した。窓辺の水槽で、影と水平線の本体が、静かに向き合った。「自分を、外から見るのは、初めて」と彼女は言った。大きすぎて全体を見たことがない人が、初めて自分の広さを眺めた夕方だった。",
          "intent": "海に、海を見せる",
          "promise": "読みにくい作戦になる代わりに、この人だけの成長を大きく進める。",
          "memory": "海が初めて自分を外から見た夕方を、二人とも覚えている。",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
